// kept in an unknown field's extra, while the action field keeps its existing
// trim rule. Per-line failures are confined to their own physical line,
// ordinary blank lines produce no record, and a healthy read/write exits 1
// (failed logs) rather than 2 (a stream fault), with stderr empty.

